---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cardi Nusantara | Perusahaan Go-To-Market - Bangun Brand - Cardi GTM Matrix™"
  description="We generate leads. We build brands. We close markets. Full closed-loop GTM system dari lead pertama sampai penjualan pertama."
  activeNav="home"
>
<main class="site-main" id="content">
 <!-- HERO SECTION -->
 <section class="hero-cn" id="hero">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="hero-media">
   <video autoplay="" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" poster="/assets/img/hero-poster.jpg">
    <source src="/assets/video/hero-bg.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>
   </video>
   <div class="hero-overlay">
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-content">
   <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">
     Indonesia's Go-To-Market Partner
    </div>
    <h1>
     We generate leads.
     <br/>
     We build brands.
     <br/>
     We close markets.
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">
     Full closed-loop GTM system: dari lead pertama sampai penjualan pertama, tanpa celah, tanpa hand-off yang hilang.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
     <a class="btn btn-lg btn-red" href="https://wa.me/62817449760?text=Halo%20Cardi%20Nusantara%21%20Saya%20ingin%20terhubung%20%2F%20konsultasi." rel="noopener" target="_blank">
      Start Your GTM
     </a>
     <a class="btn btn-lg btn-ghost" href="#loop">
      Lihat Sistem
     </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
     <span>
      <b>
       10+
      </b>
      tahun experience
     </span>
     <span>
      <b>
       500+
      </b>
      leads delivered
     </span>
     <span>
      <b>
       6
      </b>
      unit ekosistem
     </span>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <!-- MARQUEE TICKER -->
 <div aria-hidden="true" class="marquee">
  <div class="marquee-track">
   <span>
    Lead
    <b>
     →
    </b>
    Brand
    <b>
     →
    </b>
    Market
    <b>
     →
    </b>
    Sold
   </span>
   <span>
    Local Brand · Foreign Entry · GTM Execution
   </span>
   <span>
    Lead
    <b>
     →
    </b>
    Brand
    <b>
     →
    </b>
    Market
    <b>
     →
    </b>
    Sold
   </span>
   <span>
    Local Brand · Foreign Entry · GTM Execution
   </span>
  </div>
 </div>
 <!-- GTM LOOP SECTION -->
 <section class="section dark" id="loop">
  <div class="wrap">
   <div class="section-head center">
    <div class="eyebrow">
     // Full Closed-Loop GTM
    </div>
    <h2>
     Dari lead pertama sampai penjualan pertama.
    </h2>
    <p class="lead">
     Satu ekosistem yang menutup seluruh perjalanan: tanpa celah, tanpa vendor yang bocor.
    </p>
   </div>
   <div class="loop-strip">
    <div class="lbox idle">
     <div class="lt">
      LEAD
     </div>
     <div class="ld">
      Demand generated
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lbox idle">
     <div class="lt">
      BRAND
     </div>
     <div class="ld">
      Identity built
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lbox idle">
     <div class="lt">
      MARKET
     </div>
     <div class="ld">
      Channels activated
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lbox active">
     <div class="lt">
      SOLD
     </div>
     <div class="ld">
      Revenue on the ground
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="loopback">
    ↺ Data penjualan feeds back ke lead generation: loop makin kuat setiap siklus
   </div>
   <div class="loop-banner">
    <b>
     Strategy → Branding → Digital → Commerce → Scale
    </b>
    : semua di bawah satu atap, satu partner
   </div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <!-- JOURNEY / VISION SECTION -->
 <section class="section soft reveal" id="journey">
  <div class="wrap">
   <div class="vision-box">
    <div class="vision-tag">
     Cardi Vision
    </div>
    <p class="vision-quote">
     “A world where brands grow beyond selling into ecosystems owned by the public.”
    </p>
    <div class="journey-bar">
     <span>
      Idea
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Brand
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Product
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span class="here">
      Go-To-Market
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Growth
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Investment
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Exit/IPO
     </span>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="eyebrow">
    // Cardi Ecosystem
   </div>
   <h2>
    Cardi Nusantara itu apa?
   </h2>
   <p class="lead" style="margin:12px 0 44px;">
    Cardi Nusantara adalah satu dari empat unit di Cardi Business Growth Ecosystem, bagian yang menjembatani brand yang sudah punya identitas, ke pasar yang siap membeli.
   </p>
   <div class="eco-steps">
    <div class="eco-step">
     <span class="step-eyebrow">
      Step 01 · Brand Development
     </span>
     <h4>
      Build the Brand
     </h4>
     <div class="sub">
      Cardi Branding
     </div>
     <p class="d">
      Membangun fondasi bisnis melalui brand strategy, positioning, visual identity, dan go-to-market agar brand dipercaya pasar dan siap bertumbuh.
     </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       Brand Strategy &amp; Positioning
      </li>
      <li>
       Visual Identity &amp; Go-To-Market
      </li>
      <li>
       Project-Based · Build Your Brand
      </li>
     </ul>
     <span class="eco-step-cta">
      Start Brand Development
     </span>
    </div>
    <div class="eco-step current">
     <span class="here-badge">
      You Are Here
     </span>
     <span class="step-eyebrow">
      Step 02 · GTM &amp; Distribution
     </span>
     <h4>
      Launch the Brand
     </h4>
     <div class="sub">
      Cardi Nusantara
     </div>
     <p class="d">
      Mengakselerasi ekspansi bisnis melalui distribution strategy, market penetration, partnership, franchise, dan go-to-market execution untuk memperluas jangkauan pasar.
     </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       Distribution Strategy &amp; Market Penetration
      </li>
      <li>
       Partnership &amp; Franchise
      </li>
      <li>
       Growth Partnership · Launch Your Business
      </li>
     </ul>
     <a class="eco-step-cta" href="https://wa.me/62817449760?text=Halo%20Cardi%20Nusantara%21%20Saya%20ingin%20terhubung%20%2F%20konsultasi." rel="noopener" target="_blank">
      Explore Go-To-Market
     </a>
    </div>
    <div class="eco-step">
     <span class="step-eyebrow">
      Step 03 · Integrated Growth Marketing
     </span>
     <h4>
      Grow the Brand
     </h4>
     <div class="sub">
      Cardi Digital
     </div>
     <p class="d">
      Mengoptimalkan pertumbuhan melalui AI-powered marketing, performance growth, automation, SEO, dan revenue optimization untuk meningkatkan profit dan valuasi bisnis.
     </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       AI-Powered Marketing &amp; Automation
      </li>
      <li>
       Performance Growth, SEO &amp; Revenue Optimization
      </li>
      <li>
       Growth Retainer · Scale Your Growth
      </li>
     </ul>
     <span class="eco-step-cta">
      Talk to Growth Expert
     </span>
    </div>
    <div class="eco-step">
     <span class="step-eyebrow">
      Step 04 · Partner for IPO
     </span>
     <h4>
      Partner for IPO
     </h4>
     <div class="sub">
      Cardi.co.id · Cardi Agent
     </div>
     <p class="d">
      Mempersiapkan perusahaan menjadi investment-ready dan IPO-ready melalui strategi bisnis, corporate governance, investor communication, dan transformasi perusahaan.
     </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       Business Strategy &amp; Corporate Governance
      </li>
      <li>
       Investor Communication &amp; Transformation
      </li>
      <li>
       Strategic Partnership · Partner for IPO
      </li>
     </ul>
     <span class="eco-step-cta">
      Talk to IPO Advisor
     </span>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="timeline">
    <div class="tl-track">
     <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-dot">
      </div>
      <div class="tl-year">
       2016
      </div>
      <div class="tl-label">
       Foodinhands Community, Jakarta
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-dot">
      </div>
      <div class="tl-year">
       2017
      </div>
      <div class="tl-label">
       Inhands: managed brand agency
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-dot">
      </div>
      <div class="tl-year">
       2019
      </div>
      <div class="tl-label">
       Cardi Branding &amp; Cardi Digital founded
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-dot">
      </div>
      <div class="tl-year">
       2020–2025
      </div>
      <div class="tl-label">
       Cardi Nusantara: GTM partner for Indonesia
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-dot">
      </div>
      <div class="tl-year">
       2026
      </div>
      <div class="tl-label">
       Cardi: holding company, IPO Readiness-as-a-Service
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <!-- SEGMENTS SECTION -->
 <section class="section" id="segments">
  <div class="wrap">
   <div class="section-head center">
    <div class="eyebrow">
     // Untuk Siapa
    </div>
    <h2>
     GTM partner untuk dua segmen utama.
    </h2>
   </div>
   <div class="segments">
    <div class="seg local">
     <div class="seg-tag">
      BRAND LOKAL
     </div>
     <h3>
      Go National
     </h3>
     <p>
      Brand lokal dengan produk bagus tapi belum punya sistem GTM yang solid, belum bisa scale beyond founder-led.
     </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       Strategi market entry yang terarah
      </li>
      <li>
       Eksekusi lead gen &amp; digital channel
      </li>
      <li>
       Live commerce &amp; offline distribution
      </li>
      <li>
       GTM playbook yang bisa direplikasi
      </li>
     </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="seg foreign">
     <div class="seg-tag">
      BRAND LUAR NEGERI
     </div>
     <h3>
      Enter Indonesia
     </h3>
     <p>
      Foreign brand yang mau masuk Indonesia tapi tidak punya tim lokal, tidak mengerti pasar, tidak punya channel distribusi.
     </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       Local market entry strategy
      </li>
      <li>
       Brand localization &amp; positioning
      </li>
      <li>
       Digital growth + marketplace setup
      </li>
      <li>
       Full commercial execution di lapangan
      </li>
     </ul>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <!-- CAPABILITIES SECTION -->
 <section class="section soft" id="capabilities">
  <div class="wrap">
   <div class="section-head center">
    <div class="eyebrow">
     // Kapabilitas GTM
    </div>
    <h2>
     Lima kapabilitas yang menutup seluruh GTM journey.
    </h2>
   </div>
   <div class="caps">
    <div class="cap">
     <div class="cnum">
      1
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3>
       Market Entry Strategy
      </h3>
      <p>
       Positioning, pricing, dan kategori yang disesuaikan untuk konsumen Indonesia.
      </p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cap">
     <div class="cnum">
      2
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3>
       Lead Generation
      </h3>
      <p>
       Demand gen yang terstruktur, mulai dari konten organik sampai paid acquisition.
      </p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cap">
     <div class="cnum">
      3
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3>
       Digital Growth
      </h3>
      <p>
       SEO, ads, marketplace, dan live commerce dijalankan sebagai satu engine.
      </p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cap">
     <div class="cnum">
      4
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3>
       Sales Execution
      </h3>
      <p>
       Live commerce, marketplace ops, B2B outreach: produk benar-benar terjual.
      </p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cap cap-full">
     <div class="cnum">
      5
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3>
       Foreign Market Entry
      </h3>
      <p>
       Kami jadi kaki tangan brand luar negeri di Indonesia, dari hari pertama.
      </p>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <!-- INDUSTRIES SECTION -->
  <section class="section soft reveal" id="industries">
   <div class="wrap">
